---
export const prerender = true;
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import CTAButton from '../components/CTAButton.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About Sam Ghanem | Fractional CMO"
  description="Sam Ghanem is a Fractional CMO, agency founder, and speaker with a career built since 2002 on brand and marketing systems for enterprise clients."
  canonicalPath="/about"
  ogImage="/sam-ghanem-headshot.jpg"
>
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="section-inner hero-grid">
      <div class="hero-text">
        <p class="eyebrow">About</p>
        <h1 class="dz-split">
          <span class="dz-split-line"><span>I Live One Big Life.</span></span>
          <span class="dz-split-line"><span>My Business Results Reflect It.</span></span>
        </h1>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-image dz-reveal" style="--dz-delay: 0.1s">
        <img
          src="/sam-ghanem-headshot.jpg"
          alt="Sam Ghanem, Fractional CMO"
          width="600"
          height="600"
        />
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <div class="section-inner prose">
      <p class="pull-statement dz-reveal">
        A coach helps you think. A consultant hands you a deck. A CMO runs the
        department.
      </p>
      <p class="dz-reveal" style="--dz-delay: 0.04s">
        Sam Ghanem's career began in 2002. She is the Founder and CMO of SG INK, a
        full-service printing, branding, and marketing agency she built into a
        21-person team serving enterprise brands including Lockheed Martin, IBM,
        Danaher, Mercedes-Benz, Carrier, and Thermo Fisher. Her operational
        discipline shows in the numbers: more than ten consecutive years of a
        99.98 percent ISO audit pass rate, and one full brand launched from
        scratch to fully automated in three weeks.
      </p>
      <p class="dz-reveal" style="--dz-delay: 0.06s">
        She holds an MIBA with minors in Marketing and Spanish, utilizes the
        StoryBrand framework in her messaging work, and delivered a TEDx talk at
        TEDxApex titled &ldquo;It's Contagious - The Way You Treat Yourself
        Spreads.&rdquo;
      </p>
      <p class="dz-reveal" style="--dz-delay: 0.1s">
        Sam is mentored directly by Ken &ldquo;Spanky&rdquo; Moskowitz, founder of Ad
        Zombies - a 40-year advertising veteran behind 10 Super Bowl campaigns and
        $460B+ in client revenue generated. That mentorship shows up in every
        fractional CMO engagement she runs: bold, direct, and built on proof, not
        theory.
      </p>
      <p class="dz-reveal" style="--dz-delay: 0.2s">
        Her frameworks - Congruent Brands Convert, The Why Pathway, and Magnetic
        Marketing - all come from one core belief: most companies don't have a
        marketing problem. They have a messaging problem. Fix the gap between what
        you say and what you actually deliver, and conversion takes care of itself.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section-dark final-cta">
    <div class="section-inner">
      <h2>Work With Sam</h2>
      <CTAButton href="/apply" label="Apply to Work Together" />
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .hero { padding-top: clamp(3rem, 8vw, 5rem); }
  .hero-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.3fr 1fr;
    gap: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 4rem);
    align-items: center;
  }
  .hero-image img {
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 22rem;
    aspect-ratio: 1 / 1;
    object-fit: cover;
    border-radius: 4px;
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    filter: grayscale(0.15);
  }
  @media (max-width: 800px) {
    .hero-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
    .hero-image {
      order: -1;
    }
    .hero-image img {
      max-width: 14rem;
    }
  }
  .prose {
    max-width: 42rem;
    font-size: 1.05rem;
  }
  .pull-statement {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: clamp(1.3rem, 2.4vw, 1.65rem);
    line-height: 1.35;
    color: var(--ink);
    margin-bottom: 1.4em;
    padding-bottom: 1.1em;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
  }
  .final-cta { text-align: center; }
</style>
